?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless","html_url":"https://github.com/Faless","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-04T17:27:15Z","updated_at":"2024-11-04T17:27:15Z","body":"My feeling is that the debugger is becoming incredibly bloated and we really should stop putting more stuff in there.\r\n\r\nI don't even understand why we have the `__GODOT_EDITOR_STOP_SHORTCUT__` hack.\r\n\r\nThese things should be GDScript plugins if they are actually needed.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2455297999/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2455354956","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98823#issuecomment-2455354956","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98823","id":2455354956,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SWb5M","user":{"login":"Faless","id":1687918,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODc5MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1687918?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless","html_url":"https://github.com/Faless","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-04T17:54:23Z","updated_at":"2024-11-04T17:54:23Z","body":"I really would like to see a proposal to explain what problem this solves, and why it needs to be solved this way.\r\n\r\nSome questions I have by reading the PR:\r\n\r\n- Why should the client request the settings in the first place?\r\n- Why not having the editor send the relevant settings directly?\r\n- Why is this limited to EditorSettings?\r\n- What about Editor Project Metadata?\r\n- [I'll probably have more once we start discussing in a proposal.]","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2455354956/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2455395343","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98823#issuecomment-2455395343","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98823","id":2455395343,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SWlwP","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-04T18:14:58Z","updated_at":"2024-11-04T18:18:56Z","body":"> I'm not clear on the use case for this PR. Could you provide some examples of how this will be beneficial?\r\n\r\nIt's meant to be used internally when we need to access editor settings (usually in contexts related to debugging). I provided 2 use-cases that I already applied.\r\n\r\n> I don't even understand why we have the __GODOT_EDITOR_STOP_SHORTCUT__ hack.\r\n\r\nIt was added in #47744\r\nThis PR replaces it with a proper solution.\r\n\r\n> My feeling is that the debugger is becoming incredibly bloated and we really should stop putting more stuff in there.\r\n\r\nI agree it's getting bloated, but I'd just split it into multiple classes instead. Right now everything goes into one file and gets accumulated in one big if else block.\r\n\r\n> Why should the client request the settings in the first place?\r\nWhy not having the editor send the relevant settings directly?\r\n\r\nThis would mean we have to hard-code a list of settings to send when the app is launched. I considered it initially, but it's too rigid.\r\n\r\n> Why is this limited to EditorSettings?\r\nWhat about Editor Project Metadata?\r\n\r\nThey aren't needed for anything (yet).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2455395343/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2455426228","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98823#issuecomment-2455426228","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98823","id":2455426228,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SWtS0","user":{"login":"Faless","id":1687918,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODc5MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1687918?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless","html_url":"https://github.com/Faless","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-04T18:31:06Z","updated_at":"2024-11-04T18:31:06Z","body":"> It was added in #47744 This PR replaces it with a proper solution.\r\n\r\nYeah, making that configurable was probably a mistake.\r\n\r\n> This would mean we have to hard-code a list of settings to send when the app is launched. I considered it initially, but it's too rigid.\r\n\r\nIf it's for internal use, why is it too rigid?\r\n\r\n> They aren't needed for anything (yet).\r\n\r\nAnd why is this not too rigid if hard-coding the needed value is?","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2455426228/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2455608207","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98823#issuecomment-2455608207","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98823","id":2455608207,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SXZuP","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-04T20:10:21Z","updated_at":"2024-11-04T20:10:21Z","body":"Ok maybe rigid was wrong word.\r\n\r\nWith the current implementation, you request and use the settings in the same place.\r\n\r\nIf settings were predetermined, you'd have to keep two lists of settings - in the class you use them and in a central place where you have to make sure that all required settings are provided. 2 completely separate lists that must be in sync makes it more difficult to maintain. Also everywhere we wanted to access the settings would be coupled with whatever class would provide them.\r\n\r\n> Yeah, making that configurable was probably a mistake.\r\n\r\nIt was a bugfix. The engine was always using the default stop shortcut. Changing the shortcut had effect only in the editor and if you wanted to use F8 for something else in your project, you couldn't.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2455608207/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2457475476","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98823#issuecomment-2457475476","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98823","id":2457475476,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SehmU","user":{"login":"Faless","id":1687918,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODc5MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1687918?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless","html_url":"https://github.com/Faless","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-05T15:28:09Z","updated_at":"2024-11-05T15:28:09Z","body":"> With the current implementation, you request and use the settings in the same place.\r\n> \r\n> If settings were predetermined, you'd have to keep two lists of settings - in the class you use them and in a central place where you have to make sure that all required settings are provided. 2 completely separate lists that must be in sync makes it more difficult to maintain. Also everywhere we wanted to access the settings would be coupled with whatever class would provide them.\r\n\r\nI don't think this is the case, I still think this needs a proposal, where we can discuss the proper design.\r\n\r\nI think we want something akin of \"debugger settings\", that are passed by the editor and not requested by the client (which shouldn't be able to request your android keystore password, nor the file server password).\r\n\r\nBoth internal plugins, and user plugins would be able to send the setting which will be stored in a Dictionary on the debugged client, and can be read from there.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2457475476/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2457608632","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98823#issuecomment-2457608632","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98823","id":2457608632,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SfCG4","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-05T16:15:48Z","updated_at":"2024-11-05T16:15:48Z","body":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11097","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2457608632/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2663217840","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98823#issuecomment-2663217840","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98823","id":2663217840,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6evXqw","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-17T13:59:16Z","updated_at":"2025-02-17T13:59:16Z","body":"Superseded by #98891","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2663217840/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]